  "storyId": "main_4_level_main_04-02_beg",
  "groupId": "main_4",
  "stageId": "main_04-02",
  "title": "雨中漫步",
  "storyCode": "4-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4c51909419b23bc0c63c32f4597a094be1ca4fb42e7f2bcc9ee687d99e32e5d0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "還，還有兩個敵人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "他們正向東側的建築物逃竄——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "我已經瞄準他們了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "正中靶心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "噪音，會不會太大了些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "這廢城區裡爆炸聲不斷，我想，敵人也不會特別在意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "你通知凱爾希醫生了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "在戰鬥開始前，我就已經通知過凱爾希醫生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "整合運動在這片廢城中，確實有活動的跡象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "現在還在通話中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "我們是不是更加隱蔽地行動會更好一些？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "剛才的整合運動成員，似乎使用了探知型的法術。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "為了不暴露我們的位置，必須先發制人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "至少，不能讓整合運動之間互相聯絡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "呼......終於解決了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "霜葉，去看看情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "瞭解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "通訊器，拿一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "潔西卡，現在還不能懈怠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "這種事情......我還是知道的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "好的，好的，不會再說這些啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "凱爾希醫生，聽得見嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "一直在聽。確實不能懈怠——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "潔西卡，你背後可能有敵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "嗚哇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "怎，怎麼會......背後......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "......噫？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "我能從背後攻擊你，說明你動作太慢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "暫時沒事了，凱爾希醫生。我已經解決了敵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "你的速度確實好快......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "我甚至都沒看清楚你是怎麼摸過去，又那麼快趕回來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "——其實我還沒去偵查。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "紅聯繫我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "龍門內部的潛藏著的整合運動還沒有活動的跡象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "現階段還是不要打草驚蛇為妙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "順便，綜合其它廢城偵察小隊的資訊，藏匿在廢城的整合運動的規模，可能遠比想像中要大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "也就是說，中獎的反而是我們這邊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "作為偵查小隊，還是有一些壓力的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "如果這麼說的話，到現在為止，我們所消滅的，已經是第二支整合運動小隊了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "你能確認我們第一次交火的敵人的身份嗎，潔西卡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "嗯，應該沒錯的。我有好好確認過，再讓你射擊的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......怪我，光顧著計算彈道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "敵人的數量？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "還不清楚具體數字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "霜葉，你那邊如何了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "怎麼了......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "你們去吧，有問題隨時回饋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "我們......過去她那裡看看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "發生了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "......你們沒感受到嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "嗯？怎麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "溫度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "這麼一說......是有點冷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "溫度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......的確，和城區外，至少有五度以上的溫差。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "平白無故天氣就變了......怎麼會......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "抬頭看。天氣沒有變。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "不是天氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "是這裡，來，摸一摸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......廢墟的牆體？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "是的。這堵牆，在吸收熱量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "......怎麼會？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "吸溫過程，在我們來之前，可能就已經結束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "牆體正在回溫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "只是，為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "是什麼人，留下了這種痕跡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......在這個地方活動的，就只有整合運動了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "整合運動？他們......怎麼做到的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "感染者......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "我聽別人說過這麼一個傳說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "——一個，關於雪怪的傳說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......真是......令人討厭的感覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
